## Convert the local.wast to wasm and json with wast2json
wast2json: https://github.com/WebAssembly/wabt/blob/main/docs/wast2json.md

```
$ wast2json arithmetic.wast -o arithm.json
```

## Debug with aarch64-linux
```shell
$ aarch64-linux-gnu-g++ -std=c++17 -Wall -Wextra -O0 -g chapter04_main.cpp -o arithm
$ qemu-aarch64 -L /usr/aarch64-linux-gnu ./arithm

$ qemu-aarch64 -g 2345 -L /usr/aarch64-linux-gnu ./arithm
vscode debug(F5)
```

### Build and test from the repository root
```shell
cmake -S . -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Debug
cmake --build build --target arithmetic
ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure -R chapter04_arm64_gtest
```
